Subject: [PATCH] fix: restore CLI backend infrastructure and fix rebase
 regressions

- Restore 31 missing CLI backend files lost during rebase (reliability.ts,
  log.ts, bundle-mcp.ts, cli-auth-epoch.ts, cli-credentials.ts, etc.)
- Restore CLI backend types (CliBackendPlugin, PluginCliBackendRegistration,
  cliBackends on AgentDefaultsConfig/PluginRegistry/ManifestRecord)
- Restore isCliProvider + loadCliBackendRuntime in model-selection.ts
- Restore plugin-sdk exports (cli-backend subpath, anthropic-cli, provider-auth)
- Restore extension exports (anthropic api.ts CLI exports, google/openai backends)
- Fix Bot@Bot mention filtering with allBotOpenIds parameter
- Fix plugin-sdk-index.test.ts snapshot drift (remove 3 missing providers)
- Fix cli-runner.test.ts MCP loopback mocks
- Fix dispatch-from-config.ts TTS function name typo
- Delete dead code: message-received-hooks.ts (never called)
- Add session-store.ts missing imports (isCliProvider, setCliSessionBinding)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
